00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.734
-Surprise!
-Oh, my God!

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:36.767
[ Applause ]

00:02:36.767 --> 00:02:39.267
-Oh, I'm gonna --
-Happy Mother's Day!

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:40.567
How are you?

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:41.968
-Good. I can die.

00:02:41.968 --> 00:02:44.300
-We wanted to celebrate you,
Samsung wanted to celebrate you.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.100
So on top of all this,
we also have a check

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.467
