-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:52.100
[ Applause ]
Thank you so much.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.267
-Here, I can hold something.

00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:54.934
-We'll definitely share this
